---
layout: layout.njk
title: "whatis.foundation"
---

<section class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-6 py-16 sm:px-8 lg:px-12">
  <div class="space-y-6 text-center">
    <p class="text-sm uppercase tracking-[0.35em] text-brand-600">A Sacred Educational Course</p>
    <h1 class="text-4xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-slate-900 sm:text-5xl">whatis.foundation</h1>
    <p class="mx-auto max-w-3xl text-lg leading-8 text-slate-700">
      A 99-meeting course built on a parable of light, the prism, the tablets, and the rainbow staircase. The path moves from foundational elements into deep training and finally to ministerial initiation.
    </p>
  </div>

  <div class="mt-12 grid gap-6 lg:grid-cols-3">
    <article class="rounded-3xl border border-slate-200 bg-white p-8 shadow-soft">
      <p class="text-sm uppercase tracking-[0.3em] text-brand-600">Course outline</p>
      <h2 class="mt-3 text-2xl font-semibold text-slate-900">Begin with the beginning elements</h2>
      <p class="mt-4 text-slate-600">The first 22 meetings are the heaviest and most foundational. They train the learner in the identity of God, the prism, the ten words, and the staircase of light.</p>
    </article>

    <article class="rounded-3xl border border-slate-200 bg-white p-8 shadow-soft">
      <p class="text-sm uppercase tracking-[0.3em] text-brand-600">Main training</p>
      <h2 class="mt-3 text-2xl font-semibold text-slate-900">Seventy meetings of practice</h2>
      <p class="mt-4 text-slate-600">The main cycle explores each of the ten words through the seven spaces, supporting deep discernment, practical formation, and the ability to distinguish good and evil.</p>
    </article>

    <article class="rounded-3xl border border-slate-200 bg-white p-8 shadow-soft">
      <p class="text-sm uppercase tracking-[0.3em] text-brand-600">Leadership</p>
      <h2 class="mt-3 text-2xl font-semibold text-slate-900">Seven meetings of initiation</h2>
      <p class="mt-4 text-slate-600">The final seven meetings focus on becoming light, priesthood, and APESI leadership maturity, preparing learners to instruct and serve.</p>
    </article>
  </div>

  <section class="mt-16 rounded-3xl border border-slate-200 bg-white p-8 shadow-soft">
    <div class="grid gap-8 lg:grid-cols-2 lg:items-start">
      <div>
        <p class="text-sm uppercase tracking-[0.3em] text-brand-600">The course story</p>
        <h2 class="mt-3 text-3xl font-semibold text-slate-900">A parable of light, the prism, and ascent</h2>
        <p class="mt-4 text-slate-600">The course is rooted in Ezekiel 1 and Hebrews 5–6, focusing on the person of God as light, Moses as prophet-priest, and Yeshuah as the glory of creation. It is designed to support formation through scripture, practice, and a living teaching tradition.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="rounded-3xl bg-slate-50 p-6">
        <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-slate-900">Course phases</h3>
        <ul class="mt-4 space-y-3 text-slate-600">
          <li><strong>Meetings 1–22:</strong> Beginning Elements</li>
          <li><strong>Meetings 23–92:</strong> Main Training</li>
          <li><strong>Meetings 93–99:</strong> Ministerial Initiation</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  {% for section in course.sections %}
  <section id="{{ section.id }}" class="mt-16">
    <div class="mb-8 rounded-3xl border border-slate-200 bg-white p-8 shadow-soft">
      <div class="sm:flex sm:items-start sm:justify-between sm:gap-8">
        <div>
          <p class="text-sm uppercase tracking-[0.3em] text-brand-600">{{ section.subtitle }}</p>
          <h2 class="mt-3 text-3xl font-semibold text-slate-900">{{ section.title }}</h2>
        </div>
        <p class="mt-5 max-w-xl text-slate-600 sm:mt-0">{{ section.overview }}</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="grid gap-6 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4">
      {% for meeting in section.meetings %}
      <article id="{{ meeting.anchor }}" class="group overflow-hidden rounded-3xl border border-slate-200 bg-slate-50 transition hover:-translate-y-1 hover:shadow-soft">
        <div class="h-44 bg-gradient-to-br from-brand-600 to-brand-800 p-6 text-white flex items-end">
          <div>
            <p class="text-sm uppercase tracking-[0.35em] text-brand-200">Meeting {{ meeting.number }}</p>
            <h3 class="mt-2 text-2xl font-semibold">{{ meeting.title }}</h3>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="space-y-4 p-6">
          <p class="text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.25em] text-slate-500">Brief</p>
          <p class="text-sm text-slate-700">{{ meeting.description }}</p>
          <p class="text-sm leading-6 text-slate-600">{{ meeting.details }}</p>
          <div class="pt-4">
            <a href="#{{ meeting.anchor }}" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-brand-600 px-4 py-2 text-sm font-semibold text-white transition hover:bg-brand-700">Open meeting</a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </article>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
  </section>
  {% endfor %}
</section>
